  "docTitle": "CDC Data Pipeline (Debezium to Lake) - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a change data capture pipeline: read MySQL binlog / Postgres WAL with Debezium on Kafka Connect, publish one Kafka topic per table keyed by primary key, and land upserts in an Iceberg lakehouse, a search index and a cache.",
  "hero": {
