    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n          <span class=\"chip docker\">Docker</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Shopify</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Netflix</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>CDC Data Pipeline (Debezium to Lake)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Copy every insert, update and delete from your production databases into Kafka within seconds - without touching application code and without hammering the database - and keep a data lake, a search index and a cache all in step with it.</p>\n      "
